ILANG
[TYPE:config][PROJECT:vps-deals][LANG:zh]

::STATE{@SITE, brand:vpsvector, niche:VPS hosting deals, locale:en-US, domain:https://vpsvector.com}

::MODULE{PROVIDERS|title:抓哪几家 这里改了站就变}
  IONOS | https://www.ionos.com | https://www.ionos.com/servers/cheap-vps |
  OVHcloud | https://www.ovhcloud.com | https://www.ovhcloud.com/en/vps/ |
  Hetzner | https://www.hetzner.com | https://www.hetzner.com/cloud/ |
  ScalaHosting | https://www.scalahosting.com | https://www.scalahosting.com/vps-hosting.html |
  AWS Lightsail | https://aws.amazon.com | https://aws.amazon.com/lightsail/pricing/ |
  Atlantic.Net | https://www.atlantic.net | https://www.atlantic.net/vps-hosting/ |
  Alibaba Cloud ECS | https://www.alibabacloud.com | https://www.alibabacloud.com/product/ecs |

::MODULE{FIELDS|title:每条优惠提取什么}
  title price currency discount_percent offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at

::MODULE{RENDER|title:页面渲染规则}
  index: list current public offers, source URL, fetched date, and provider.
  provider: group offers by provider with canonical URLs.
  deal: one page per extracted offer with JSON-LD Offer when verified fields exist.
  compare: ItemList comparison page for all currently discovered offers.
  og_image: build.py 为每页生成 1200x630 的 og/<slug>.png 纯标准库 PNG 社交预览图。
  structured_data: deal 页用 Offer 加 BreadcrumbList，provider 页用 Service 加 AggregateOffer，列表页用 ItemList。
  update_frequency: every 6 hours by GitHub Actions cron.

::MODULE{SOCIAL|title:只生成 GitHub 审核队列}
  github: 每次只从新抓到且来源明确写出百分比折扣的优惠中选最大一条。
  queue: data/social_queue.json；只排队，不自动发到 X 或 Facebook。
  rule: 没有明确 discount_percent 就保持空队列，不从价格反推折扣。

::MODULE{AFFILIATE|title:联盟变现规则 build.py 真的读这一节}
  programs: 只接 CJ ShareASale Impact 这类公开联盟平台 按它们的公开条款办
  slot: PROVIDERS 每行第四个字段就是联盟链接 留空则用厂商官方裸链
  pick: 优先挑留得住客户的offer 管理型主机 按年抽成 而不是一次性低价
  disclosure: Some outbound links on this site are affiliate links. If you buy through one, this site may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Prices and terms always come from the provider's own public page.

::RULE{抓不到 price=>这条不写 price 字段 也不写进结构化数据 不许拿估的填}
::RULE{valid_until 已过=>status 标 expired 页面标过期 结构化数据用 OutOfStock 且不写 priceValidUntil 不许留着冒充有效}
::RULE{disclosure 只在页面里真的出现联盟链接时才渲染 没有联盟链接就不声明}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金 品牌词竞价 cookie 注入 自买自推|scope:permanent}
